# Symmetric on an empty sketch: a plumb segment L1 (v1 kept) and five
# points. Tool first, P3, P4, then L1: symmetric(P3, P4, L1). On the
# selection of P5, P6 and P7: symmetric(P5, P6, P7).
open tests/data/sketch-blank.json
wait 16
action tool.segment
wait 2
click L 579 558
click L 579 120
action tool.point
wait 2
click L 469 284
click L 700 273
click L 415 449
click L 743 449
click L 606 531
key Escape
key Escape
wait 2
action tool.symmetric
wait 2
click L 469 284
click L 700 273
click L 579 202
wait 2
key Escape
wait 2
select element P5 element P6 element P7
action tool.symmetric
wait 4
